concave from peripheral to central collisions indicating an increase in transverse radial flow. We'll come back to this issue in chapter 6.

STAR has published the spectra of \(\pi\)/K/P in Au + Au and pp collisions on Phys. Rev. Lett. [129]. We did a comparison by dividing our results by the PRL results, see Fig. 4.15. We can see our results are consistent with the published results within 10% errors.

