#### Batch System and Parallel Processing

In the field of high-energy physics experiment, the data volume is very large because of the statistics purpose. In general, there are millions of events to be processed, the procedure to process each event is the same. The difficulty here is just the large scale. Thus, a batch system is appropriate for the farm. LSF38 from platform computing corporation is a good choice, but the price is too high for the small farm. Fortunately, there are many other open source batch system available. Such as OpenPBS39+Maui40, SGE41, Condor42. For this farm, these three software are installed for comparison. Also, to prepare a possible upgrade to a member of a grid, and to make full use of the available computing resource in the local institutions, Globus43 is set up for test too.

